Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's up, brother?\N-Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-You got a better idea?\N-Okay, fun. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-So when do we, you know?\N-We don' t, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No cooking until things settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down? l thought you' re the one\Nthat said nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l just put my family\Nthrough an ordeal...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...that they're just now\Nstarting to accept, okay? l can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l can't leave my house...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...for more than 20 minutes\Nwithout my wife worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I need time to mend fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so while you' re fixing fences,\Nwhat about me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your A-hole brother-in-law\Ntook all my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's $600.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what about the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Rest of what?\N-Half your money' s mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-fifty partners.\NThat's our business motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning what, exactly?\NThat I suffer for your carelessness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re the one who wanted\Nto work with Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. lf it weren't for that,\Nnone of this would've happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be cool.\NWe' ll talk about this later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As for now, no contact. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Walt!\N-ln the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. I didn't know\Nyou were allowed to touch the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilarious, Groucho.\NGo on, grab a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Juice is on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good morning, honey.\N-Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's cooking breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But don' t worry.\NI'm also doing all the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice? Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also orange juice\Nand grapefruit juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...which, personally, as you know,\NI've never been a fan of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But considering all the polyphenols\Nand the limonoids, can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, you didn't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Grapefruit juice?\N-Yes, please. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go. Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll stick with orange, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Dig in, dig in.\NPancakes are not getting hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.\N-There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Got one. Steely Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-No.\N-Yes, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, in terms of pure musicianship...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...l would put them up against\Nany current band you can name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't know\Nany current bands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's besides the point.\N-Have a good day, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Boz Scaggs. There's another one.\N-Boz Scaggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever they are.\NBye. Thanks for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bye.\N-You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Louis to drive carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our son doesn't know\Nwho Boz Scaggs is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have failed as parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-...I barely know who Boz Scaggs is.\N-Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your plate.\NNo, no. I'll get it. l'll get it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the calendar section...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...all week long...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...there's a fiction writer's seminar\Nat UNM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And, you know, probably talking\Nabout how to get published...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-...and that sort of thing.\N-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so, anyway,\NI thought maybe you might....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, l'll go with you if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...you know, l was thinking about\Nwhat you asked me the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You were wondering\Nif l had a second cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And, well, I've been\Nthinking about that a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...and l think what you heard\Nwas my cell phone alarm going off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been using it a lot\Nas a medication reminder...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...to, well, remind me\Nto take my medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And, well, the weird thing is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...the alarm sound\Nis almost exactly the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...as the regular phone ring\Nwhich is really a poor design...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...if you ask me.\NBut l think that was probably it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to go in\Nand change it to a different sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...other than the phone ring, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They so overcomplicate\Nthese things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it was probably\Njust as well that l lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a new one\Non the market by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if we do this thing\Nat UNM, maybe on the way home...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...we can stop by,\Nand l can get a new cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ready?\N-Yo, for what, might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse Bruce Pinkman...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...pursuant to Section 47-8-1 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...of the New Mexico\NReal Property Code...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...you are hereby\Ngiven notice to vacate...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...the premises listed as 9809 Margo,\NAlbuquerque, 871 04.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. What? You' re kicking me\Nout of my own house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-lt's your Aunt Ginny' s house.\N-And she gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She never gave it to you, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You were allowed\Nresidentiary privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents have always\Nbeen the property owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we talked about this, okay?\NI'd sell the house, we' d split it fifty-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the deal.\NWhat the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened is\Nyou' re a speed manufacturer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A DEA agent came\Nlooking for you, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to our front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, because I've actually\Nbeen helping them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...which I could get into\Na lot of trouble for telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...so you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried, so l went\Nover there and I let myself in...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.89,0:11:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...and l found your laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have your own key?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Manufacture of a Schedule lI\Ncontrolled substance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...is a second degree felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Under federal asset seizure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...the government can take\Nthe entire house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not even there anymore.\NI cleaned it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, we can't stop you\Nfrom ruining your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...but you will not drag us down\Nwith you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Vacate the house in 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,\Nyour parents have authorized me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...to contact the authorities.\NIs that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any questions for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days, Mr. Pinkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hi.\N-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-l fixed the garage door.\N-Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One track was bent.\NThat's why it was bouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where were you today?\N-Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, for what it's worth, I was thinking\Nabout going back to those meetings...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...the cancer support group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that that' s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right\Non the money about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...talk about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse. Hey, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't answer your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, l've just been...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...pretty busy. How'd you--?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, you have that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So l've been thinking\Na lot about our conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...we had the other day,\Nand l completely get why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...Dad totally tweaked off on me\Nlike that and....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-lt's not just your father, Jesse.\N-No, I know. l know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying it was a really,\Nreally big wake-up call for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...which is why l wanted to talk\Nto you. You know, l've been...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...thinking real seriously\Nabout business school, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do the whole thing\Nfrom your computer now....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mom, Mom.\NHey, hey, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we're talking,\Nstarting a dialogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for talking\Nhas passed, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-l thought it was just a wake-up call.\N-We are putting it in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When you decide to grow up,\Nyou can have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don' t you grow up, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginny wanted me here.\NI was the one who took care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I took her to her appointments\Nand made her lunch every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I earned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You did not make\Nher lunch every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She' s lying there dying,\Nand where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't start with me.\N-Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You' ve decided to, l don' t know,\Nmake your eldest son homeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Great family, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you like this? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have two sets of keys\Nand the padlock to the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them on the kitchen counter\Nwhen you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mom, Mom, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where am l supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But please turn your life around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is gonna help\Nbigtime with that. Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, well, that's the way.\NDon't just sit out there honking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in and say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've got omelets.\NYou want an omelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,New Mexican Christmas style,\Nred and green chilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Flynn and me gotta get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who's Flynn?\N-Flynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Flynn?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-You ready?\N-Like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bye, Mr. White.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Flynn? You know about this\NFlynn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Flynn. Yeah.\NAs in what, Errol?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. lt's what he likes\Nto be called these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Walter Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants his own identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he told Louis about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-About the blackout?\N-Louis is his friend, Walt...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...and your disappearance\Nupset him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I made omelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out, but thanks, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you get the phone, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-White residence.\N-Yo, it' s me. Is this a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of "no contact"\Ndidn' t you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-l know, but there's a problem.\N-I don't care. We agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No amount of pay-per-view channels\Nis gonna make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, we' re happy\Nwith our cable provider, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler? Sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?\NCan you at least tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Should probably get that, Walt.\NI'll be back in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Yo, l get l shouldn't call...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...but l'm in a situation here,\Nand l need my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gave you $600.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks, Daddy Warbucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...but that was\Nbefore my housing situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...went completely\Ntesticular on me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You smoked the entire 600,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-What? No.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-No.\N-Look, Jesse...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...your problems are just that:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No contact. Do not call here ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-When the moment is right, I will call.\N-Mr. White, you're not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re kicking me out of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man. Hey, guy!\NYou forgot something! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot your ice trays!\NYou' re gonna need the ice trays!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you forgot something here!\NTake this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, we should get Twaughthammer\Nup and running again, yo. l'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. That sounded tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks again, P.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure this stucknut exterminator,\Nyou know, put me on his speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Two nights tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you still staying\Nat your aunt's on Margo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l'm thinking of moving.\NNob Hill, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jess-a-matic. Living the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.43,0:22:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, buddy. You're gonna eat your\Ncarrots like we talked about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, buddy. Remember. Okay?\NCome on, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, hey, talk to me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.86,0:22:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still having\Nmad relations out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can talk to me.\NI won't hate a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lie. It's pretty hectic\Nout there, female-wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn. l'm hating, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.33,0:22:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need to get the\NHammer up and running, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Get you out of the house.\N-How awesome would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Look. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut all the green parts off like you--\NJust eat them. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We should do this. Track down\NCheevo and Anthony and demo up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back in the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, man.\NJust hold on one second, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen. How about\Nyou take a bite of your sandwich...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:22:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then you take--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy' s home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hi.\N-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, honey, you remember\NJesse Pinkman?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His house is getting bug bombed.\NI said he could crash a few nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, Jesse.\N-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul, could you help me\Nin the bedroom with these?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.25,0:23:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l used to not like carrots too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hen, l think\Nit' s someone's nap time. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, dude, you're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally spaced that the in-laws\Nare crashing this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.39,0:24:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You got other people to call?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's cool.\NI got tons of people. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?\N-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, in-laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.60,0:24:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sucks to be you, P.\N-Yeah. Yeah, l know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.48,0:24:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.95,0:24:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l'm asking to crash three,\Nmaybe four nights, and--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.45,0:24:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l already called Badger,\Nall right? l called everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.62,0:24:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a solid here, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.17,0:24:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.46,0:24:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. All right.\NHey, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.43,0:24:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's just for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.74,0:25:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. No, you cannot be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-You cannot be serious.\N-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.87,0:25:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone took your bike, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.50,0:25:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.11,0:28:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Morning.\N-Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.70,0:28:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.53,0:28:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did--? Where did Mom go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.20,0:28:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.13,0:28:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.05,0:29:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.93,0:29:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.56,0:29:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Something fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.52,0:29:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, ready? Let's put it in gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.65,0:29:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-ls your foot on the-- Okay. Good.\N-Yeah. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Nice and smooth. Good.\NJust like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.58,0:29:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I like the hands at 1 0 and 2.\NVery nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.92,0:29:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's slow down here...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.42,0:29:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...to a stop in preparation\Nfor a left-hand turn. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.75,0:29:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. You might wanna\Ngo easier on the brake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry about that.\N-That's all right. You're doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.80,0:29:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Much better than last time, huh?\N-Oh, yeah, Louis has been helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.77,0:29:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.43,0:29:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.98,0:29:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the turn indic-- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.23,0:29:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop talking.\NYou know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.86,0:29:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And let' s make that left-hand turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.07,0:30:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice and smooth. Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.99,0:30:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are you using both feet?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.17,0:30:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Wait. Wait. No, Walt.\NYou can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.55,0:30:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't use one foot\Non each pedal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why not?\N-Because you can't. Stop, Walt. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just stop, please. Right. All right.\N-Dad, this is way easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.14,0:30:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the easy way,\Nand then there's the right way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.19,0:30:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just try it again,\Nright foot only.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-All right.\N-Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.78,0:30:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just-- You don' t have to--\NOkay. All right. That' s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.41,0:30:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just-- That's okay. That' s okay.\NJust try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.49,0:30:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.\NLet's just, just try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.33,0:30:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:30:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't-- Just easy.\NOkay, okay, good. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.54,0:31:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was better. See?\NRight? Better? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.26,0:31:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas, the brake,\Nthe gas, the brake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.17,0:31:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.30,0:31:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs don't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.22,0:31:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your legs are fine.\NYou just have to stick with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.26,0:31:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't set limits for yourself, Walt.\NYou' re all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.39,0:31:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. We'll get this. l promise.\NNow let's just try again. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.02,0:31:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-All right.\N-Here we go. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.32,0:31:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, you don't need to,\Nyou know, just take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.49,0:31:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But all right, here we go.\NSlow it down just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.45,0:31:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we have a turn coming up\Nhere, so prepare to apply the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.33,0:31:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare, Walt, for the brakes.\NBrakes, the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.87,0:31:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Braking.\N-You're using both feet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.87,0:31:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-lt's not stopping.\N-That's the gas. Use the brake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.38,0:31:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The break. Brake, brake, brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.30,0:31:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one way to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.18,0:31:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.06,0:31:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Flynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.88,0:33:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hands up, asshole!\N-Yo, yo, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So help me, I will spread you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, no, all right?\NIt's me, okay? lt's Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.64,0:33:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? Look, this is my RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.97,0:33:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You towed it.\NYour cousin Badger, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.81,0:33:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-You smell like shit.\N-lt's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.15,0:33:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So l fixed up your felonious\Nrolling laboratory here...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.86,0:33:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...750 for the repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it a grand, counting the toilet\Nplus the 500 you already owe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.70,0:33:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you're good to drive on out of\Nhere to someplace far away. Upwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.66,0:33:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.58,0:33:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pay you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But l can pay you this week,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.75,0:33:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen fifty? We'll make it 1 750,\Nfor, like, you know, interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.97,0:33:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-l thought your word was your bond.\N-lt totally is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.10,0:33:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely. l just don' t have\Nthe money at this particular moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.97,0:34:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But l will, soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.73,0:34:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my counteroffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.90,0:34:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I kick you out.\NI take payment from your inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.23,0:34:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a guy that' ll pay\Npremium for this kind of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.07,0:34:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Two grand. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Two days, two grand.\NThat's totally fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.54,0:34:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't take my cook stuff.\NAll right? That' s all l got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.21,0:34:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, all right? l really....
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.75,0:34:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I really need a break here.\NOkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.55,0:34:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Clovis, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.49,0:34:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NThere's a bunch of stuff in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.87,0:35:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something called\Nmethylamine. Me-- Meth....
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.79,0:35:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,However the hell you pronounce it.\NMethylamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.41,0:35:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. l banged on it.\NIt sounds pretty full to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.55,0:35:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit. How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.73,0:35:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.14,0:36:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.77,0:36:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Louis took Walt to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.44,0:36:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.82,0:36:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...this would be a good time to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.68,0:36:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I dreamt that l owned\Nan antique bicycle repair shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.93,0:36:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In lreland.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.69,0:36:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.96,0:37:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.42,0:37:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...desire for privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.64,0:37:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My emotional...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.89,0:37:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...unavailability.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.56,0:37:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Having cancer\Ndoesn't excuse all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven' t been\Na good partner to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.03,0:37:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...and for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.95,0:37:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...l'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.16,0:37:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.54,0:37:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And l love this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.08,0:37:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And l just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.46,0:37:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...want to make sure that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.25,0:37:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...we don't lose contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.35,0:38:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.35,0:38:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.02,0:38:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.12,0:38:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.42,0:38:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,God, how long are\Nyou gonna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.17,0:38:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do what?\N-This.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.55,0:38:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.93,0:38:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Going out all day\Nand refusing to tell me where.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You are obviously angry with me\Nabout something...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.72,0:38:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...so let' s talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.44,0:39:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.03,0:39:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like you' re upset with me\Nbecause you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.28,0:39:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...that l'm up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.54,0:39:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like what?\N-l have no idea, Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What, that l'm having an affair?\NIs that it? ls that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.34,0:39:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you asked me\Nabout the....
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.59,0:39:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Some other phone? Because\Nyou think that I'm being unfaithful?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.10,0:39:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-l don't know.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.22,0:39:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.48,0:39:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Would you even tell me?\N-Yes. I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.81,0:39:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.86,0:39:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And no. l'm not.\NI'm not having an affair, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what do I do\Nto prove that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.20,0:39:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Swear an oath? My right hand\Nto God. l'm not having an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.87,0:39:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.08,0:39:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re not having an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.58,0:39:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.04,0:40:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you know what?\NCongratulations to you, Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.67,0:40:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.96,0:40:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.88,0:40:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-l'm trying to talk to you, and you--\N-Okay, so talk, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.30,0:40:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and say something\Nthat isn't complete bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.23,0:40:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know\Nwhat you have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.02,0:40:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to tell me\Nwhat's really going on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.27,0:40:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Today. No more excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.32,0:40:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No more apologies.\NNo more of these-- These obvious...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.53,0:40:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...desperate breakfasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.58,0:40:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna lose\Ncontact with me, Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.58,0:40:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.96,0:40:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.97,0:40:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.57,0:41:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.11,0:41:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you want me to tell you?\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re not done here. Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.55,0:41:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what\NI've done for this family?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.26,0:41:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What the--?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.74,0:41:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yo, l'm really sorry, okay?\N-What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.12,0:41:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you blue? Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.83,0:41:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Let's just say it starts\Nwith my parents being greedy...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.46,0:42:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-...kleptomaniac douchebags.\N-Are you actually this stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.46,0:42:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, look. l know this isn't a optimal--
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.46,0:42:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To come to my house and park\Non my street, driving this vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.80,0:42:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what the hell is wrong\Nwith you? l'm really asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.51,0:42:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nothing. l'm sorry. l just--\N-What if Skyler had seen you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.39,0:42:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What then? What was the plan then,\Ngenius, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.48,0:42:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-l don't know.\N-You know why you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.02,0:42:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you don't think. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.40,0:42:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think.\NYou never figured out how to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.32,0:42:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I said l was sorry. l just need\Nmy half of the money, and I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.20,0:42:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your half?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.82,0:42:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no your half of the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.53,0:42:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only my all of it.\NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.29,0:42:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I be penalized\Nbecause of your sloppiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.79,0:42:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that is completely uncool,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.96,0:42:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed, fifty-fifty partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Partners in what?\NWhat exactly do you do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.22,0:42:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask,\Nbecause l'm the producer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.64,0:42:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I cook. But from what I can tell,\Nyou are just a drug addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.06,0:43:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a pathetic junkie,\Ntoo stupid to understand and follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.48,0:43:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...simple rudimentary instructions.\NToo stupid to re--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.59,0:43:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:44:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.65,0:45:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some breakfast?
